  "gGoalT": "The goal",
  "gGoal": "A town hides a few Mafia. The Mafia win when they are as many as everyone else. The town wins when every Mafia is out.",
  "gRolesT": "The roles",
  "gNightT": "Night",
  "gNight": "Everyone takes a secret turn. The Mafia choose someone to eliminate, the Doctor protects someone, the Detective checks someone (never the same player twice), the Bodyguard guards someone. Citizens tap anyone, so nobody can tell roles apart. A tied Mafia vote goes to the Godfather's pick; if he is out or didn't vote, to the Mafia in the lowest seat who voted.",
  "gDayT": "Day and reveals",
  "gDay": "The narrator reveals who died. Then everyone talks: who is lying? Then the town votes someone out, or nobody.",
  "gTipsT": "Tips",
  "gTips": "Keep your role secret. One phone for the table, or each on their own phone online.",
  "gTableT": "Table rules",
  "gTable": "Out players stay silent and don't hint at their role. Never show your screen, and never look at someone else's turn. You may claim any role out loud, true or false: lying is part of the game.",
